sequenceDiagram
  participant Zoom as Zoom Webinars
  participant API as Spring webhook API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL (receipts = database queue)
  participant W as Receipt worker (same process)
  participant R as Report worker (same process)
  participant Reports as Zoom API (reports, registrants)
  Zoom->>API: Signed participant join/leave webhook
  API->>API: Validate signature + timestamp + payload
  API->>DB: Unique receipt (academy + body SHA-256)
  DB-->>API: Commit durable record
  API-->>Zoom: 2xx acknowledgement
  W->>DB: Claim due receipts (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
  W->>DB: One occurrence event per receipt; link occurrence to its class
  Note over W,DB: Failures retry with backoff, then DEAD; staff replay with a reason
  Zoom->>API: Webinar ended
  R->>DB: Occurrence due 15 min after its end
  R->>Reports: Participant report (paginated), webinar host, approved registrants
  Reports-->>R: Join sessions per person
  R->>DB: Store report rows (host marked, registration email kept)
  Note over R,DB: Staff finalise from the report by the academy's rule; a missing event is never proof of absence
